  "configuration_id": "config_030",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile settings (0.650 accuracy) with scvi_n200 RNA encoder outperform singleprofile and PCA-based models. This experiment tests whether adding image data (resnet50) to the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multimodal setup with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion can further improve accuracy. It isolates the effect of multimodal integration while leveraging the best-performing RNA encoder and profile setting, balancing exploration of image data's value with minimal changes to proven components."
}

